1
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,952
TRURL: Hold still. There.
What happened to you?

2
00:00:12,952 --> 00:00:16,669
BONHOMIUS: I was a hermit, kind
sir, sixty-seven years in a cave.

3
00:00:16,709 --> 00:00:19,560
One morning I saw that it
was wrong to live alone,

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,143
when my first duty was
to help my neighbour.

5
00:00:22,943 --> 00:00:25,238
In the city I met your friend Klapaucius.

6
00:00:25,278 --> 00:00:29,833
He had gone looking for the beings at the
Highest Possible Level of Development.

7
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:41,105
He found them on a square
planet, under a square sun.

8
00:00:43,705 --> 00:00:48,185
KLAPAUCIUS: Excuse me. Is this the
Highest Possible Level of Development?

9
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:56,048
BONHOMIUS: They lay in the sand and
scratched themselves, and would not answer.

10
00:01:00,648 --> 00:01:04,731
So he built a machine that could model
one of them, and asked it instead.

11
00:01:05,731 --> 00:01:10,382
KLAPAUCIUS: If you are gods, your duty
is clear. Banish the misery of others!

12
00:01:11,382 --> 00:01:14,410
THE GNOSTOTRON: We tried,
sixty-four thousand times.

13
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:18,580
When a civilization starts straightening
humps, there is no end to it.

14
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:26,300
One can accomplish something only so
long as one cannot accomplish everything.

15
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,833
BONHOMIUS: Surely there is
something you can give us!

16
00:01:30,833 --> 00:01:34,751
THE GNOSTOTRON: Very well. Here is
a formula that has not been tried.

17
00:01:34,791 --> 00:01:36,168
No good will come of it.

18
00:01:42,968 --> 00:01:47,324
BONHOMIUS: Whoever takes it, everyone
within fifty yards feels what he feels.

19
00:01:47,364 --> 00:01:48,905
It has no effect on robots.

20
00:01:51,905 --> 00:01:54,593
I dropped one pinch into
the well of a country inn.

21
00:01:55,705 --> 00:01:57,868
In the barn, a cow was giving birth.

22
00:02:18,105 --> 00:02:21,124
On the bridge to the city
my suitcase fell open.

23
00:02:24,124 --> 00:02:27,474
Forty kilograms went into the
stream the whole city drinks from.

24
00:02:31,474 --> 00:02:33,266
By night the city had drunk it.

25
00:02:42,274 --> 00:02:44,383
A toothache was everyone’s toothache.

26
00:02:49,474 --> 00:02:53,136
A cat chased a mouse in the
cellar, and the whole hotel ran.

27
00:03:01,874 --> 00:03:05,679
They drove a widow out of town,
because they could not bear her grief.

28
00:03:07,474 --> 00:03:11,405
Then two men stopped in front of me.
One struck the other in the face.

29
00:03:19,874 --> 00:03:21,458
A POLICEMAN: That one felt nothing.

30
00:03:29,874 --> 00:03:34,143
BONHOMIUS: They broke every plate in me,
and fired what was left out of a cannon.

31
00:03:34,183 --> 00:03:36,736
Going up, I could see the
rivers carrying it on.

32
00:03:38,936 --> 00:03:40,722
I only wished to make them happy.

33
00:03:45,522 --> 00:03:46,253
TRURL: And now?

34
00:03:47,253 --> 00:03:52,079
BONHOMIUS: Now I am cured, kind sir, of
making anyone happy by revolutionary means.

